<font size=2>投稿者：<font color=DF0000><b>Reto</b></font>　投稿日：2002/05/16(Thu) 02:37:10</font><br><font color=DF0000><font color=#FF0000>[01] </font>フリフリー<br><font color=DimGray> **A Magic Die 0 to 100. turned up <b><font color=#FF0000>66</font></b>.</font></font></td></tr></table></div>
